@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = test.user@example.com
@password = secret123
@userId = 1
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}


### ============================================
### Obtener perfil de usuario
### ============================================

### Iniciar sesión (obtener token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Obtener perfil por userId (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener perfil — Sin token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles/{{userId}}

### Obtener perfil — userId no numérico (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles/not-a-number
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener perfil — Usuario no encontrado (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
